&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;서류 반환 정책&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;%1.&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;13&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[65533,0],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;%1.&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;본&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;고지는 『채용절차의공정화에관한법률&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;』&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;제11조제6항에 따른 것 입니다.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;%1.&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;13&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[65533,0],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;%1.&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;당사 채용에 응시한 구직자 중 최종 합격이 되지 못한 구직자는 『채용절차의 공정화에 관한 법률』에 따라 제출한 채용서류의 반환을 청구할 수 있음을 알려 드립니다. 다만, 홈페이지 또는 전자우편으로 제출된 경우나 구직자가 당사의 요구 없이 자발적으로 제출한 경우에는 그러하지 아니하며, 천재지변이나 그 밖에 당사에게 책임 없는 사유로 채용서류가 멸실된 경우에는 반환한 것으로 봅니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;%1.&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;13&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[65533,0],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;%1.&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;위2항 본문에 따라 채용 서류 반환 청구를 하는 구직자는 채용 서류 반환 청구서 [채용절차의 공정화에 관한 법률 시행규칙 별지 제 3 호 서식]를 작성하여 이메일 (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:recruitingops@coupang.com&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;recruitingops@coupangfs.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;) 로 제출하면, 제출이 확인된 날로부터 14 일 이내에 지정한 주소지로 등기우편을 통하여 발송해 드립니다. 이 경우 등기우편요금은 수신자 부담으로 하게 되오니 유념하시기 바랍니다. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;%1.&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;13&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[65533,0],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;%1.&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;당사는 위2항 본문에 따른 구직자의 반환 청구에 대비하여 채용 여부가 확정된 날로부터 180 일간 구직자가 제출한 채용서류 원본을 보관하게 되며, 그때까지 채용서류의 반환을 청구하지 아니할 경우에는 『개인정보 보호법』에 따라 지체 없이 채용서류 일체를 파기할 예정입니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;%1.&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;13&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[65533,0],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;%1.&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;단, 위 1항 내지 4항의 내용은 대한민국의 노동 관계 법령이 적용되는 경우에만 적용됩니다. 그 이외의 경우에는 적용되지 않습니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

alphapartners-coupang:greenhouse:7912434.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company Introduction &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We exist to wow our customers. We know we’re doing the right thing when we hear our customers say, “How did we ever live without Coupang?” Born out of an obsession to make shopping, eating, and living easier than ever, we’re collectively disrupting the multi-billion-dollar e-commerce industry from the ground up. We are one of the fastest-growing e-commerce companies that established an unparalleled reputation for being a dominant and reliable force in South Korean commerce. &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud to have the best of both worlds — a startup culture with the resources of a large global public company. This fuels us to continue our growth and launch new services at the speed we have been since our inception. We are all entrepreneurs surrounded by opportunities to drive new initiatives and innovations. At our core, we are bold and ambitious people that like to get our hands dirty and make a hands-on impact. At Coupang, you will see yourself, your colleagues, your team, and the company grow every day.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission to build the future of commerce is real. We push the boundaries of what’s possible to solve problems and break traditional trade-offs. Join Coupang now to create an epic experience in this always-on, high-tech, and hyper-connected world.  &lt;br&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Staff SAP ABAP Developer, you will be a core technical contributor within Coupang’s Global Accounting Technology (GATE) team, delivering high-quality ABAP solutions that power our mission-critical financial operations. You will independently own end-to-end development — from requirements analysis and technical design through implementation, testing, and production deployment — across multiple SAP modules.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role demands a seasoned developer who can work autonomously with minimal supervision, resolve production incidents independently, and maintain the highest standards of code quality and testing rigor. You will serve as a technical anchor for the team — setting quality standards, conducting code reviews, and mentoring junior developers — while delivering complex ABAP solutions at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work across SAP ECC and S/4HANA environments, supporting Coupang’s ongoing transformation from legacy SAP systems to a modern S/4HANA landscape. The ideal candidate combines deep ABAP expertise with strong problem-solving skills and the discipline to deliver reliably in a high-volume, fast-paced e-commerce environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Independent End-to-End Development&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full development lifecycle for assigned SAP workstreams — from functional specification analysis through technical design, coding, unit/integration testing, and production deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business requirements into robust technical solutions with minimal guidance, independently determining the optimal approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver across multiple SAP modules (FI/CO/MM/SD) with deep process understanding and cross-module awareness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle concurrent development tasks while maintaining quality and meeting delivery timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Code Quality &amp;amp; Development Standards&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and enforce coding standards, naming conventions, and best practices for ABAP development within the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead code review processes — review junior developers’ code against established quality criteria, provide constructive feedback, and maintain consistency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write well-structured, performant, and maintainable ABAP code that serves as a reference for the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and own test strategies including unit testing, integration testing, and regression testing with clear coverage targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Production Support &amp;amp; Incident Management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently investigate and resolve production incidents without escalation — perform root cause analysis (RCA) and implement permanent fixes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose system performance issues in ABAP programs, database access patterns, batch jobs, and interfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute go-live checklists, cutover plans, and rollback procedures for deployments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and stabilize high-volume financial processes including month-end close, mass posting, and settlement operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Performance Optimization &amp;amp; Technical Excellence&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and resolve performance bottlenecks in ABAP code, SQL access, and data processing routines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize batch job execution, interface throughput, and report generation for high-volume scenarios&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze and refactor legacy custom code to improve maintainability, performance, and alignment with SAP best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply SAP performance tuning techniques (runtime analysis, SQL trace, buffer optimization) systematically&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;S/4HANA Transition Support&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the ECC-to-S/4HANA conversion by analyzing custom code impact, identifying simplification items, and adapting existing programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop new solutions aligned with S/4HANA architecture principles — CDS Views, ABAP for HANA, and Clean Core guidelines where applicable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in migration testing, data validation, and technical cutover activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Technical Mentoring &amp;amp; Knowledge Sharing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor junior and mid-level developers through pair programming, code reviews, and technical guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain technical documentation — design patterns, troubleshooting guides, and onboarding materials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to knowledge-sharing sessions and technical brown bags to raise the overall team capability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in technical interviews and hiring assessments for new team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;  &lt;strong&gt;Basic Qualifications &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Information Systems, Engineering, or related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of SAP ABAP development experience with proven end-to-end delivery (design → implement → test → deploy)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independent ownership of 2+ SAP modules (FI/CO/MM/SD) with full business process understanding of owned modules&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Production incident response &amp;amp; RCA experience — demonstrated cases of resolving critical issues independently without escalation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Test strategy ownership — experience establishing unit/integration/regression testing approaches with self-driven coverage targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Code review leadership — track record of reviewing junior developers’ code and setting enforceable quality standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of SAP data model, table relationships, and cross-module data flows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in ABAP development including Reports, Module Pool, ALV, Smart Forms/Adobe Forms, BAPIs, BADIs, User Exits, and Enhancement Framework&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independent technical specification writing and design review leadership experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentoring track record — technical onboarding program design or structured knowledge transfer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SAP S/4HANA migration or conversion project experience (custom code adaptation, simplification)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fiori/UI5 development experience or ABAP RESTful Application Programming (RAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with CDS Views, AMDP, and ABAP for SAP HANA optimization techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of SAP integration technologies — IDocs, RFC/BAPI, PI/PO, or Integration Suite&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;E-commerce, retail, or logistics domain experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CI/CD pipeline experience, Git-based version control, and automated testing frameworks (ABAP Unit, eCATT)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Korea financial system experience (Firm Banking, e-Tax Invoice, virtual accounts, GIRO)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Type of work model&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Details to consider&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Those eligible for employment protection (recipients of veteran’s benefits, the disabled, etc.) may receive preferential treatment for employment in accordance with applicable laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Privacy Notice&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your personal information will be collected and managed by Coupang as stated in the Application Privacy Notice located below. &lt;a href=&quot;https://privacy.coupang.com/en/land/jobs/&quot;&gt;https://privacy.coupang.com/en/land/jobs/&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

alphapartners-coupang:greenhouse:7924413.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;회사 소개&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;쿠팡은 고객 감동 실현을 위해 존재합니다. 고객들이 &quot;쿠팡 없이 그동안 어떻게 살았을까?&quot; 라고 말할 때, 비로소 우리의 미션을 실현하고 있음을 알 수 있습니다. 고객들의 쇼핑과 식사, 생활 전반을 편하게 만들겠다는 유일한 집념으로 쿠팡은 수억 달러 규모의 커머스 산업 전반의 혁신을 이끌고 있습니다. 쿠팡은 가장 빠르게 성장하는 리테일 기업 중 하나로, 국내 커머스 업계에서의 독보적인 입지와, 고객 신뢰를 구축했습니다.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;쿠팡은 스타트업 문화를 기반으로 한 글로벌 대형 상장사라고 자부합니다. 이것이 창립 당시의 기민함을 유지하며, 신규 서비스를 끊임없이 출시하며 비즈니스를 확장해 나가는 우리의 성장 동력입니다. 쿠팡의 모든 임직원에게는 기업가 정신을 갖추고 새로운 혁신과 이니셔티브를 추진할 수 있는 기회가 주어집니다. 주저 없이 일에 뛰어들어 성과를 이루고자 하는 과감성이, 바로 쿠팡이 일하는 방식의 본질입니다. 쿠팡에서는&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;여러분 자신, 동료, 팀 그리고 회사 전체가 매일 성장하는 모습을 목격할 것입니다.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;쿠팡의 모든 직원은 커머스의 미래를 만들겠다는 쿠팡의 미션에 진심입니다. 우리는 고객의 문제를 해결해 나가고, 전통적인 관념과 통념에 맞서며 실현 가능한 한계를 뛰어넘고 있습니다. 고가용성 (always-on) 과 최첨단의 앞선 기술 (high-tech), 초연결사회 (hyper-connected world) 에서의 놀라운 업무 경험을 원하신다면, 지금 바로 쿠팡에 합류하세요.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;팀 소개&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Finance조직 내 자금 부문은 회사의 자금 입·출금 및 흐름을 전반적으로 관리하는 부서입니다. 안정적인 자금 운용을 통해 적정 유동성을 유지함으로써 재무적 안정성을 추구하며, 자금 관리의 정확성과 운영 완성도를 높이기 위해 SAP를 비롯한 관련 시스템과 프로세스를 지속적으로 개선·고도화하고 있습니다. 또한 내부통제 체계 운영과 감사 대응을 통해 자금 관리의 기준과 절차를 체계적으로 정립하고 있습니다. 이러한 업무 전반의 역할 특성에 따라, 내부 유관 부서 및 외부 기관과의 원활하고 긴밀한 커뮤니케이션 역량이 필수적으로 요구됩니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;업무 내용&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;자금 Operation 및 결산 관리&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;자금 관련 시스템 및 업무 프로세스 개선고도화&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;자금 계획 수립 및 분석&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;자금 운용 전략 수립 및 유동성 관리&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;내부통제 체계 운영 및 내외부 감사 대응&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;금융기관 등 외부 기관과의 업무 협의 및 커뮤니케이션&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;자격&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;요건&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;재무(회계, 자금) 관련 총 경력 6년 이상, 자금 업무 경력 최소 5년 이상&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;자회사 및 관계사 자금재무 관리 경험&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SAP 및 뱅킹 시스템 개선 및 고도화 경험&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;내부통제 운영 및 감사 대응 경험&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;적극적이고유연한 사고를 바탕으로 한 문제해결 역량&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;데이터 및 수치 기반자료를 능숙하게 다룰 수 있는 수리감각&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;내부 유관 부서 및 외부 이해관계자와의 원활하고 명확한 커뮤니케이션 역량&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;우대&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;사항&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;외화 입출금 처리 및 외국환 신고 등 외환 관련 실무 경험&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;S/4 HANA 시스템 구축 프로젝트 참여 경험 또는 실무 사용 경험&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;영어 기반의 업무 커뮤니케이션 가능자&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;경영/경제/회계학 등 관련 전공&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;재무관련 자격증 보유자&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;전자상거래 및 배송 서비스 비즈니스에 대한 관심과 이해&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
