&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Speech Language Pathologist (SLP) – Home Health | Per Diem&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;North Bergen, NJ | Serving Hudson County&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;At BAYADA Home Health Care we believe our clients deserve care delivered with compassion, excellence, and reliability in the comfort of their own homes. We are currently seeking an experienced&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Speech Language Pathologist (SLP)&lt;/strong&gt; to join our growing team on a &lt;strong&gt;per diem basis&lt;/strong&gt; supporting adult and geriatric clients throughout Hudson County, NJ.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;This is an excellent opportunity for an SLP looking for flexibility, autonomy, and meaningful one-on-one patient care.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why You’ll Love This Opportunity&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible per diem scheduling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manageable geographic territories&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;One-on-one patient care in the home setting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supportive multidisciplinary team environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tablet-based documentation and streamlined technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career growth, training, and scholarship opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognition for the impact you make every day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;As a Home Health Speech Language Pathologist, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide in-home speech therapy evaluations and treatments for adult and geriatric clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess, diagnose, and treat speech, language, communication, cognitive, and swallowing disorders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop individualized treatment plans in collaboration with physicians and care teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modify care plans as patient needs evolve&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Educate patients and caregivers to promote safety, independence, and improved quality of life&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with nurses, therapists, and interdisciplinary team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complete timely electronic documentation using a tablet-based EMR system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Current NJ Speech Language Pathologist license required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certificate of Clinical Competence (CCC-SLP) preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home health experience preferred but not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and organizational skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with electronic documentation/EMR systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;At BAYADA, our employees are our greatest asset. We offer:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive pay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PTO and comprehensive medical, dental, and vision benefits (eligibility based on status)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career advancement opportunities and clinical support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ongoing training and professional development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A values-driven culture that truly supports its clinicians&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Join a company where you can make a lasting difference one patient at a time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apply today to learn more about this rewarding opportunity with BAYADA Home Health Care.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Aptos; font-size: 12.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;Additional Information:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
