&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;One year experience as a Speech Language Pathologist&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
