&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About The Role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a Solutions Engineer, at Buzz Solutions, you will play a pivotal role in driving the adoption of our AI-powered solutions, PowerAI and PowerGUARD, within the electric utility sector. This role combines pre-sales technical consulting (60%) and post-sales customer enablement (40%), ensuring a seamless experience from initial engagement through solution adoption through AI / ML based projects. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is a high-impact role for someone who thrives on solving complex problems, loves working directly with customers, and enjoys strategic thinking and hands-on execution. You will be the face of Buzz Solutions for some of the nation’s largest utilities, guiding them through adopting and integrating our AI solutions. You will engage in deep business and technical discovery, creatively position our value in their workflows, and collaborate closely to maximize their success.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are looking for someone who is self-driven, resourceful, and eager to grow—someone who sees this role as an opportunity to demonstrate their expertise, shape the future of AI in utilities, and make a real industry impact. If you enjoy working on a mix of technical challenges, client engagement, and strategic problem-solving, we want to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
